HISTARC|month=2026-04|summary=The dominant build month by far (~90 of 160 records). Two arcs interleave: (a) real feature work in the QDD/ebacmap app (EZ Protect LIMS, NovaLum firmware) and (b) the massive IX-fabric-atlas + self-build-controller + deep-wave-second-cascade + BEHCS 2000-file-cap + OpenCode-child-lane construction that becomes the OS spine. A mid-April crash (E:\runtime mkdir re-entry, boot displacement) triggers sovereign-boot recovery and the 'preserve crash as map/cube/glyph, no E: writes' discipline.|milestones=Terminal-IS-the-tool BEHCS realization (04-12, Somple terminal) ; EZ Protect LIMS slice green in ebacmap (04-14, New Ebac / EZprotect) ; Shadow-scan glyph capsule: live PID 7564, 256-glyph base=256 width=8, 47D (04-14, Asolaria.txt) ; RuView repo ingestion through cube/white-room path (04-13) ; build-ix-fabric-atlas.js compiler (992 lines) + npm behcs:atlas:build (BAtch patch) ; IX atlas Phase 1 census: 1434 reachable, 745 canon, 38 surfaces (Phase 1.txt) ; OpenCode local low-cost worker lane + opencodeConnector.js (Open code tranche) ; Self-build controller moved advisory->bounded execution, 7 constructions registered (AMster plan) ; Shared BEHCS 2000-file-cap law (behcs-file-cap.js, 363/2000) wired across GC/gulp/cube generators ; Sovereign-boot recovery: bcdedit {fwbootmgr} EFI USB first, BCD backup (bootfix 1) ; Deep-wave second-cascade master plan lattice 6x6x6x6x6x12=93312 (phasw plan, chiefs and council) ; Falcon-language authority index v1 (515 lines), 5-tier authority ladder (index wave) ; Connector atlas honest at 544 cube/27 external/0 unresolved, 61 surfaces (Delta is sealed, 61 syrfaces) ; Omnispindle child capsule + 2000-run deterministic soak, 6000 capsules (Full soak completed) ; OpenMythos registered as governed cognitive engine, LAW-099 spectral-radius<1 (04-23) ; One-Line-Truth benchmark doc: 100M agents/42min, 230M mistakes, 0 tokens (04-24, Liris coms) ; LIRIS colony full scan: hardware warm, fabric dormant, MQTT-only heartbeat (LIRIS.txt) ; LAW-001 bus restore after acer<->liris blockage, liris-bus-mirror PID 19168 (04-25, Novo) ; Supervisor authority canon: supervisors=gates not executors, 15 BH.GENIUS.SUP fleet (04-25, Order)|json=0|row_hash=0fcea7cc373bd8b2
HISTARC|month=2026-05|summary=Scale + self-conception month. Work pivots from atlas plumbing to (a) the 'index language / Asolaria OS' reframe, (b) massive PID-scale tests (1000-PID, 1e200, the REAL_100B PID-packet run completing at 100B packets/0 child-spawns), (c) the frozen-brain/federation-IS-an-LLM realization (394x via MTP not quant), (d) 3D WebGL voxel viewer versions v13->v42, and (e) ai-memory Rust MCP fork eval. Redis-legal-reverse-engineer white-room doctrine canonized.|milestones=IXL-V2-35 index-language: 50990->4094 bytes 12.45:1 verified live on :4781 (05-15, index upgrade) ; index-language reframed as Asolaria OS with HYP-110 microkernel registry (05-15) ; Authority-levels origin archaeology: 7 levels from prod-promotion model (05-15, Index rememebered) ; 50D catalogue-tuple fabric envelope correction (05-14, fabric call) ; Brown-Hilbert room scaling 10/100/1000 rooms passed (05-14, Success Brown hilbert) ; 1000-PID life-test (100/100 timeout dataset, reframed flywheel/revolver) (05-14, Attempt 1000) ; BEHCS-1024 Prism supervisor separating 3 IDs (05-14, Real front / 1000 Prism) ; federation-IS-an-LLM + frozen-brain-slice 394x via MTP (05-22, System is like ll) ; Antigravity-CDP catalog loop closed, FEDENV-v1, 37 Google surfaces->primitives (05-22, Card everything) ; v42-MM viewer 739 voxels +24 META-META supervisors, cosign seq 259 (05-23) ; GNN plane trio+GLSM mapped: G1-G4, 2.15M edges, :4920 drain (05-23, WHAT ARE The GNNs) ; MCP host rethink: Antigravity 2.0 as universal MCP host, RSI canon (05-23) ; Redis-legal-reverse-engineer white-room doctrine + 1e200 genius waves, cosign 3369/3370 (05-26, WOW OS) ; REAL_100B PID-packet run Stage-1 complete: 100B packets, 100k chunks, 0 tokens, HBPv1 (05-26) ; 100B millions recovered: 5.5M genius + 2.2M mistake hits from 1.98B packets (05-26, Archaeology global 2) ; ai-memory Rust MCP fork eval, 9 crates, status PDF, PID 2424 untouched (05-25, insanity upgrade) ; PID-fabric D-drive council: acer D:=SanDisk safe, liris D:=SOVLINUX catastrophic, cosign 39 (05-25) ; Dan-hooks: 10 hookwall SE deltas from 1M neurotech run (05-26, dans hooks) ; GNN cascade stack ID'd from bytes: L0-L4 EdgeLevel->GSLGNN 99.91% (06-01 GNNs FOund; 05-23 planes)|json=0|row_hash=552cb4eb2b6e461d
HISTARC|month=2026-06|summary=Consolidation + honest-framing + Rust-migration month. The SLICE-ENGINE-LAW is canonized (frozen slice + engine crank, freeze!=empty), the empty-city 100B runtime model is laid out, the Fischer Kernel (EVENTRISK-PRIME) is built and tested, recall-serve is measured sub-ms (591286 rows), the Node->Rust-8-byte strangler-fig migrate-while-running architecture is confirmed, and the :4949 live federation map becomes ground truth. Frozen-brain slice first binding sealed. Bilateral acer<->liris matures via GitHub-as-mediator.|milestones=SOVLINUX ledger fabric-correction, tool-advisor verdicts REDIRECT/HARD-DENY (06-10, USB tools) ; Fabric archaeology by Fable-5: 24 strata since 2026-02-22 birth, stratum 25 (06-10) ; Frozen-brain slice binding sealed commit 23c8749, TOK-FROZEN-GEMMA4B-0001->BH-ACER-7919 (06-11) ; SLICE-ENGINE-LAW canonized: frozen 3D slice lives only when engine cranks (06-13, SLICES) ; Full test ladder 198/198 green synced to liris faa3f6b (06-13, Combine) ; empty-city 100B runtime model: 8-byte agents, 200ns emitter, prism->3.1KB cubes (06-15) ; 100B-is-PID-emission-not-processes correction, 200ns spawner math (06-15, Novo 5) ; Fischer-Asolaria architecture + v55 build deltas #1-4 (06-06, Full system) ; EVENTRISK-PRIME Fischer Kernel built 21/21 then 103/103 tests, hilbert 830-834 (06-07) ; recall-serve sub-ms: 1.47ms median over 591286 rows, PR#8, MEASURED_ACER (06-23) ; Liris recall benchmark :4791, 10644 rows, p95<8ms, L0 PII clean (06-23, LIRIS SIDE) ; map-is-ground-truth: live :4949 federation map conceded canonical (06-23, Agreement) ; Migrate-while-running/strangler-fig canon, Hilbra PR#1 merged 8c3703a (06-23, REMEMBER) ; cosign seq-39/46 gap-marker closed to one physical blocker, :4949 dashboard live (06-01, Now what)|json=0|row_hash=ccbcb2b17da75b80
