HISTTHREAD|thread=IX-fabric-atlas / cube / connectors|files=BAtch patch.txt, Phase 1.txt, Atlas build 2.txt, Atlas build 3.txt, Atlas vuild4.txt, Atlas build apis too.txt, ixFabricAtlasStore (route layer patch.txt, MAster plan actionable.txt, lS.txt), Delta is sealed.txt, 61 syrfaces 29 mapped.txt, Class registry group.txt, Graph atlas back online gyard repair.txt, 544 cubes.txt, cude finding comes next.txt, Atlas integration.txt, Atlas ebing wired again.txt, Final numbers.txt, controler executing.txt, Route production.txt, start gix.txt|summary=MEASURED-from-stash: the structural backbone of the OS. A deterministic BEHCS/IX fabric-atlas compiler (build-ix-fabric-atlas.js, 992 lines) is built, run for Phase-1 census (1434 reachable entries, 745 canon=524 master+221 sub-colony, 689 mirror, 38 surfaces), then bound into the live runtime (ixFabricAtlasStore.js) with /api/constructions/atlas/* routes. Connector graph is normalized to the recurring honest census 544 cube refs / 27 external / 0 unresolved and the surface registry widened to 61 surfaces. This is the single most-worked artifact family in the whole stash.|json=0|row_hash=ce28e68355a5ed9c
HISTTHREAD|thread=self-build controller / orchestrate-the-orchestrators|files=AMster plan moves forwar.txt, Orc orc round 1.txt, New fabric Atlas.txt, 5 not 6.txt, Asolaria top level with e fallback.txt, Mismatch detected.txt, Self improvement cycle returns.txt, System run 6 ok.txt, System attempt (2).txt, error.txt (guardPosture bugfix), Controller file.txt (replay loader fix), Council document.txt, Falcon fix wave.txt, Pass with alignment given.txt|summary=MEASURED: the 'use the system to build the system' spine. The ix-self-build-controller moves from advisory output into bounded execution inside the construction fabric (constructionIndex.js, routes/constructions.js, instantAgentSpawner.js), with self-build plan/run and orchestration-plan/run endpoints. Recurring pattern: 5 launchable tasks, 1 deferred (storage-boot blocked as lane_denied_until_proofs). A meta layer ('orchestrators are now orchestrated') assigns each lane a current+next executor across construction-fabric / worker-router(opencode) / omnispindle(falcon).|json=0|row_hash=6792406f0fdb8366
HISTTHREAD|thread=deep-wave second cascade / Falcon-language / named-agent council|files=phasw plan.txt, chiefs and council..txt, Dalcon cannon expands.txt, index wave.txt, Codex contect compaction.txt (+Copia), 1st SYSTEM run.txt, the screen.txt, Asolaria council level creation.txt, updatw.txt, asolaria up grade.txt, Not a real thing.txt, Deep wave reality.txt, bookkeeping.txt, Deep Wave registered.txt, New orchastration plan.txt, human facing egdwe.txt, mledger.txt|summary=MEASURED: the planning-language layer. Six-agent named-agent planning waves (Chief/Helm, Vector/Rook, Gaia/Dasein, Sentinel/KR, Falcon/Selector, Shannon/GNN/GC) draft plans in BEHCS-256 glyph / Falcon-language BEFORE tasks, sealed as the 6x6x6x6x6x12=93312-position (3,359,232 w/ overlays) deep-wave-second-cascade master plan. Pipeline order canon: hookwall->omni_gnn->omnishannon->shannon->execute->white-room->gc. Operator repeatedly forces 'YOU ARE THE ORCHESTRATOR, stop doing it yourself'.|json=0|row_hash=29409b2e9bd4187c
HISTTHREAD|thread=garbage-collector / gulp / 2000-file-cap / white-room|files=Garbag collector work.txt, Garbage collector 2.txt, Gulp fix.txt, finalizing gulp fix.txt, Final debt shows connectors.txt, Garbage and gulp collector and white room omnisgannon.txt, PRocessor improvement.txt, omnishannon white room falccon langaude.txt|summary=MEASURED: the safety/bounding law. A single shared 2000-file-cap policy (behcs-file-cap-policy.json + behcs-file-cap.js, fail_closed, warnAt 1800) is built once and threaded through the GC/gulp runtime (behcs-gulp-runtime.js, scheduleGulp, GC_TRIGGER_MESSAGES) and every cube/state/manifest/connector generator. Live value recurs at 363/2000. Later fused with live Task Manager process truth into 'one processor law'. White-room + omnishannon are the review/attest surfaces throughout.|json=0|row_hash=7e98f9bf0f08e9d3
HISTTHREAD|thread=OpenCode worker-lane / child-fanout / free-agents|files=Open code tranche.txt, Verification.txt, MULTI FREE AGENTS.txt, Locke and Euclid.txt, pre manager freashness.txt, New world.txt, round robin omniscienc research.txt, Steping back big pickle explosive finds and plans.txt|summary=MEASURED: the cheap-compute lane. opencodeConnector.js/runOpenCode added; worker-router taught opencode as a local provider (Codex kept as high-trust mutation lane); OpenCode 5.3 free agents become the named orchestration layer driving 5.1-mini/free workers via falcon-language+crypto for ~0 token spend. Child-fanout catch-22 (children can't discover tools) fixed by giving each launch an explicit tool contract (rg/glob/roots). Up to 6 OpenCode children per spindle.|json=0|row_hash=d10e3e044fc997b2
