HISTTHREAD|thread=GNN / hookwall / reverse-gain / Shannon|files=GNN.txt, GNN attempt.txt, GNNs FOund.txt, WHAT ARE The GNNs.txt, Emit EVERYTHIGN TO THE HOOKWAL AND GNN input output.txt, dans hooks in the fabic upgrade genius idea.txt, proper GPU and CPU monit.txt, Somple terminal to agent.txt|summary=MEASURED: the cognition/gate layer. The full GNN cascade is identified from model bytes + intrusion-detection paper — L0 EdgeLevelGNN (:4792, 91.87%), L1 PrototypeGNN (94.24%), L2 ContrastiveGNN (94.71%), L4 GSLGNN (:4793, 99.91%) — with runtime planes G1 edge-mining / G2 forward-genius / G3 reverse-gain / G4 GLSM (2.15M edges). Honest caveat recurs: the real Python GNN weights fail to load (state_dict/conv1.bias mismatch) even when JS gate smoke passes. Universal-route insight: every message dual-emits to destination + hookwall+GNN.|json=0|row_hash=1ae17a2c680c98ec
